+//     green screen at boot, functional (not timing - #66 met +0.058ns).
+//   - ramcinhibit = a4091_ena, i.e. run all fast RAM uncached while O57 is
+//     on (build #67): magenta/garbage crash - cpu_cache_new's cache_inhibit
+//     path only blocks new allocations, it is not a safe sustained-bypass.
+// DMA/CPU coherency for the a4091 is handled driver-side instead: after a
+// DATA-IN DMA completes, a4091.device walks a scratch buffer to evict the
+// stale line from the RAM-controller read cache before reading the result.
+assign ramcinhibit  = 1'b0;
+
+// ---- a4091 DMA routing ---------------------------------------------------
+// Zorro-fast target -> ddram_ctrl's dma port (Z3 fast is in DDR).
+// Anything else (chip / motherboard RAM) -> sdram_ctrl's dma slot.
